1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,300
This is Rocco, the little monster truck.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,800
He wants to make the big jump!

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,800
Vroom! Oh no...

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:10,400
Splat! Right in the mud. But Rocco doesn't give up!

5
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,500
He tries again.

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:15,700
Up, up, up, he flies!

7
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,900
Bump! He did it!

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,900
Rocco's Big Jump. A story book your child colors, and reads.

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,500
For ages three to six. Link in bio!

